{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>身兼鋼琴與聲樂老師、創辦演藝教育中心的學院派掌門人康絃（Connie），在TVB節目《唱錢》中以輕鬆心態應戰，視之為一個遊戲。然而，當她挑戰王菀之名曲《我真的受傷了》時，卻緊張得手部動作冇停過；轉頭唱容祖兒快歌時又秒變派對女王，極大反差感震驚全場，連評判Eric Kwok都大讚可愛！</p><p>挑戰《我真受傷了》緊張到手震</p><p>Connie雖然音樂資歷豐富，但在挑戰王菀之的《我真的受傷了》時，賽前信心似乎出現裂縫，直言：「呢首歌我唱過好多次，相對有啲難度，有好多轉音，比較難拿捏。」評判Eric Kwok亦給出建議，指此曲需要淡定和足夠氣息。然而，Connie在演唱時明顯相當緊張，手部動作全程「冇停過」地跟隨節拍，唱得「一步一驚心」，令台下應援團都看得非常投入，齊齊「頭搖式打拍子」，氣氛相當肉緊。</p><p>Connie自信鑽研新唱法「我梗係繼續玩」</p><p>作為演藝教育中心的掌門人，Connie的專業背景毋庸置疑。她賽前表現得非常輕鬆，認為這次參賽不會影響其學校聲譽，更透露為節目鑽研了新唱法：「我覺得今次係一個遊戲，係唔係好影響我學校？除非我自己真係好失準，如果唔係我覺得唔會，今次遊戲形式我都鑽研咗我另一個唱法。」而在選擇挑戰策略時，她更展現出極強的好勝心，直言：「我梗係繼續玩。」</p><p>唱《全身暑假》大解放 Eric Kwok讚「勁可愛」</p><p>正當大家以為Connie是溫文爾雅的類型，她挑戰天后容祖兒的經典K歌《全身暑假》時，竟瞬間大變身！她化身成派對女王，跟隨強勁拍子「瘋狂搖擺」，再加上「手勢多多」，手指跟隨歌詞輕快跳動，台風活潑可愛，與唱慢歌時的緊張模樣判若兩人。這股歡樂氣氛感染了全場，連評判Eric Kwok都忍不住大讚：「勁可愛。」</p><p>網民大讚反差萌：估佢唔到！</p><p>Connie的驚人反差表現引來網民熱烈討論，不少人留言大讚。有網民表示：「估唔到平時教唱歌嘅老師可以咁活潑！完全估佢唔到！」「呢啲咪就係反差萌囉，唱慢歌好緊張，唱快歌即刻放飛自我，好得意！」「Eric Kwok都話可愛，證明真係得！」「佢搖得好放，睇到都開心埋一份！」「好期待佢之後嘅表演！」</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/01_19175331576a6847b3b81ac.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/02_16773165426a6847b604fa5.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/03_14423627206a6847b963f56.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/04_7390694326a6847bd7a622.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/05_4670251356a6847c0eea2d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/06_3432626466a6847c45dcdf.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/07_11936454846a6847c79c77d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/08_15816685086a6847cb7b2a6.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/09_7254256326a6847ceacfd6.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/10_8606163106a6847d3087b0.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/11_16036389406a6847d62b947.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/12_9091989516a6847d9da1f7.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/13_6158344826a6847dd4d30e.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/14_12011069346a6847e0b063c.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/15_17390488516a6847e41bd4f.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/16_312014626a6847e731d5a.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/17_12518282986a6847eab2d8d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/18_10745126236a6847ee65a28.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/19_11612716196a6847f21b870.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/20_6829291886a6847f64e0ce.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/21_17425899686a6847fab7a59.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/22_20177770726a6847fe7ccfe.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/23_17286477166a6848028f2dd.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/24_281177656a684807a28ff.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/25_875158636a68480b52703.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/26_12266142776a68480f1798e.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/27_12038591036a684812c9ff1.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/28_7037412256a684817d8413.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/29_12638056866a68481c73e12.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/30_11568593616a6848201bd92.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/31_6771247336a684823a4c26.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/32_10798924546a684827d7814.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/33_14084405796a68482c37ab6.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>還有什麼演唱會消息？</p><p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇： 演唱會時間表及購票資訊 ，包括 MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排 、 容祖兒 、 鄭秀文 、 張學友 、 鄭中基 、 溫拿 、 羅志祥 等。</p><p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？</p><p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看 Netflix劇集 和 BL劇 最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些 室內好去處 室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇： 離島行程攻略 或是行山，這些 行山好去處 路線簡易，新手也適合。</p><p>Tags : EricKwok tvb即時資訊 唱錢 康絃</p><p>圖片來源：TVB 資料或影片來源： 原文刊於新假期</p><p>Jul 28 2026</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-28T09:22:22.031822+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1267,"images":33,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none"}}